    "title": "Prichard code enforcement officer charged with federal gun offense - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brendan Kirby ,\n7 hours ago MOBILE, Ala. (WALA) - A Prichard code enforcement officer has been arrested on a federal gun charge and is a suspect in a rape investigation, according to court records. A criminal complaint filed in U.S. District Court charges Albert McCreary, 55, of Daphne, with being a convicted felon in possession of a firearm. He remains held at Mobile County Metro Jail, awaiting an initial appearance in federal court scheduled for Thursday. Mobile County Personnel Board record show he has worked for the city of Prichard since September 2023. Read full article\n3",
